# Tenhou counterpart: Feeding the 4th kan for Suukantsu does NOT trigger Pao
# (engine.md §4.2 Pao, rules.md §1 pao_suukantsu, §4.32).
# Seat 1 makes 3 closed kans (1m, 9m, 1p), then Seat 0 discards 9p -> Seat 1 calls daiminkan on 9p (4th kan),
# draws rinshan 7s and wins by tsumo (Suukantsu)!
# Because Suukantsu has NO pao on Tenhou, all 3 opponents pay normally (non-dealer 1x yakuman = 8000 / 16000),
# NOT 100% by Seat 0!

[meta]
name: no_pao_suukantsu_tenhou
title: Tenhou Suukantsu fed by daiminkan has no pao and splits tsumo payment normally
rules: tenhou
source: engine.md §4.2, rules.md §1, §4.32

[round]
wind: E
round: 1
honba: 0
sticks: 0
dealer: 0
scores: 25000 25000 25000 25000

[wall]
hand 0: 9p 258m 36p 148s 1234z
hand 1: 1111m 9999m 1111p 7s
hand 2: 247m 258p 259s 1236z
hand 3: 368m 47p 369s 23467z
dora: 1z 2z 3z 4z 7z
rinshan: 9p 9p 9p 7s
draws: 5z 6z 3p 4p 6z

[steps]
0 tsumogiri 5z
# Seat 1 draws 6z, declares 3 ankans -> rinshan[0..2] give three 9p! Discards 6z.
1 ankan 1m
1 ankan 9m
1 ankan 1p
1 discard 6z
2 tsumogiri 3p
3 tsumogiri 4p
0 discard 9p
window: 1=daiminkan
1 tsumo

